&reftitle.description;
voiddebug_print_backtrace intoptions0 intlimit0
debug_print_backtrace stampa un backtrace PHP. Stampa le chiamate di funzione, i file inclusi con include/require e il codice valutato con eval.

    &reftitle.examples;



      Esempio di debug_print_backtrace


<?php
// file include.php

function a() {
    b();
}

function b() {
    c();
}

function c(){
    debug_print_backtrace();
}

a();

?>




<?php
// file test.php
// questo è il file da eseguire

include 'include.php';
?>


     &example.outputs.similar;


#0  c() called at [/tmp/include.php:10]
#1  b() called at [/tmp/include.php:6]
#2  a() called at [/tmp/include.php:17]
#3  include(/tmp/include.php) called at [/tmp/test.php:3]
